---
title: "Refresh Your Sign-In"
permalink: "/session-refresh/index.html"
layout: page
---
<p>
  Your sign-in is still valid, but it was issued before your access was last
  updated, so it doesn't yet carry your editor permissions. Signing in again
  refreshes it.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="/.auth/logout?post_logout_redirect_uri=/admin/">Sign in again and return to the editor</a>
</p>

<p>
  If you land back here after signing in, your account isn't assigned to the
  website editor app in Microsoft&nbsp;365. Ask an administrator to add you, then
  sign in again.
</p>
